            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1012-f2" n="43" xml:id="d1012-f2-content">
                <p>Reference is to the international convention relative to the treatment of
                    Prisoners of War, signed at Geneva, July 27, 1929; for text, see <ref
                        target="frus1929v01#pg_336">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1929, vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">i</hi>, p. 336</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
